            "description": "<p>Meta (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/META\">META</a>) recently announced a $27 billion deal with Blue Owl Capital (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/OWL\">OWL</a>) to fund and develop a new data center.</p>\n<p>Blue Owl Capital co-CEO, Marc Lipschultz, joins Market Catalysts host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?fr=sycsrp_catchall\">Julie Hyman</a> to discuss the private credit market and the risks of investing in the artificial intelligence (AI) space.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
